    boundaries: ["An Event rule is deterministic routing configuration, not permission for a model to emit Events.", "--source and --job identify organizational provenance; neither grants tools or authority.", "Rules currently support task.completed and same-Enterprise evaluation.", "Captured search snippets remain unverified third-party evidence."],
